  "title": "Qt: Make the progress bar actually move and work on KDE",
  "description": "At least on KDE (and also the old deprecated QGnomePlatform) on Linux,\nif a style sheet is set for the main component of the QProgressBar but\nnot the chunk, then the progress bar doesn't seem to work at all.\nThe default color is the Highlight (or Accent) color for the chunk\n(on other platforms too, on most themes), so let's use that.\n\nhttps://doc.qt.io/qt-6/stylesheet-examples.html#customizing-qprogressbar\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
